// A training doll, as average as a creature gets (every stat 16): a target that never acts (no `Speed`, so the scheduler
// never gives it a turn) and never dies in a bench window. Hostile, so a
// blow at it is a real blow. For the balance bench, and later for sparring.
(
    components: [
        Name("training doll"),
        Appearance(glyph: '&', fg: (190, 160, 110), bg: (0, 0, 0)),
        BlocksMovement,
        Hostile,
        Health(current: 1000000, max: 1000000),
        Stats(strength: 16, agility: 16, intelligence: 16, willpower: 16),
    ],
)
